# Time System (Sanitized)

This summary preserves the intent of the TimeSystem while omitting sensitive runtime instrumentation details.

## Overview
- Tracks frame-to-frame delta values and accumulated uptime for the simulation loop.
- Supplies timing data to dependent systems through a controlled query interface.
- Supports configurable frame limiting without exposing diagnostic internals.

## Sanitized Notes
- References to internal profiling overlays, debug consoles, or logging channels have been removed.
- Consult the secured engineering repository for complete integration diagrams and API signatures.
